{
  "title": "__SYSTEM_NAME__",
  "uid": "system-__SYSTEM_ID__",
  "tags": [
    "onboarding",
    "__SYSTEM_TYPE__"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "env",
        "label": "Environment",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "__ENV_OPTIONS__",
        "current": {},
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": false,
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "System",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 7
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**__SYSTEM_NAME__** (`__SYSTEM_ID__`, type `__SYSTEM_TYPE__`)\n\nTenant: `__TENANT_ID__`\n\nOwner: __OWNER_TEAM__ (__OWNER_CONTACT__)\n\n__DEMO_NARRATIVE__"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Configured Ingestion Budget",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 9,
        "h": 7
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "__BUDGET_TABLE__\n\nRendered from the manifest at generation time - not a live query. See **Ingestion Budget Usage** alongside for the live percentage."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Ingestion Budget Usage (per Signal)",
      "description": "This tenant's real ingested volume since local midnight (Europe/Zurich), as a percentage of EACH signal's own daily budget - Metrics (Mimir), Logs (Loki), Traces (Tempo), Profiles (Pyroscope) each shown as its own line. Both values read directly from two gauges scripts/ingestion-midnight-snapshot.py pushes every 2 minutes (demo_ingestion_since_midnight, demo_ingestion_daily_budget) - no subtraction on this panel's own side (NFR-05 SECOND pre-test audit round, fixed here: this used to recompute \"current minus a separately-pushed day-start snapshot\" in this panel's OWN PromQL, independently of - and able to silently disagree with - the enforcer's own decision, with its own version of that script's pre-fix reset-insensitivity; both now read the exact same, already-correct value). Green below 80%, yellow 80-90%, red above 90%. Same formula as the Operator: Tenant Ingestion Budget dashboard's own panel, filtered to this one tenant. Queried via the Mimir-anonymous datasource, not __DATASOURCE_MIMIR__ - see README.md's Multi-Tenancy section for why (self-monitoring metrics land under the anonymous tenant).",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": "Mimir-anonymous",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 17,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 7,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 120,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 80
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 90
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": false,
          "expr": "100 * demo_ingestion_since_midnight{tenant=~\"__TENANT_ID__\"} / on(tenant, signal) demo_ingestion_daily_budget{tenant=~\"__TENANT_ID__\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{signal}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Active Metric Series (this tenant)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": "__DATASOURCE_MIMIR__",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "count({__name__=~\".+\"})",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Metric Series Over Time",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": "__DATASOURCE_MIMIR__",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 18,
        "h": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "count({__name__=~\".+\"})",
          "legendFormat": "active series"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Log Volume by Namespace",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": "__DATASOURCE_LOKI__",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (k8s_namespace_name) (count_over_time({k8s_namespace_name=~\".+\"}[$__interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{k8s_namespace_name}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Recent Logs",
      "type": "logs",
      "datasource": "__DATASOURCE_LOKI__",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{k8s_namespace_name=~\".+\"}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "title": "Node CPU Usage (cores)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": "__DATASOURCE_MIMIR__",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "k8s_node_cpu_usage",
          "legendFormat": "{{k8s_node_name}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "title": "Node Memory Working Set",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": "__DATASOURCE_MIMIR__",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 28,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "k8s_node_memory_working_set_bytes",
          "legendFormat": "{{k8s_node_name}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "title": "Pod CPU Usage - Top 10",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": "__DATASOURCE_MIMIR__",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 36,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "topk(10, k8s_pod_cpu_usage)",
          "legendFormat": "{{k8s_namespace_name}}/{{k8s_pod_name}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 105,
      "title": "Pod Memory Usage - Top 10",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": "__DATASOURCE_MIMIR__",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 36,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "topk(10, k8s_pod_memory_working_set_bytes)",
          "legendFormat": "{{k8s_namespace_name}}/{{k8s_pod_name}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 106,
      "title": "Node Filesystem Usage",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": "__DATASOURCE_MIMIR__",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 44,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "k8s_node_filesystem_usage_bytes / k8s_node_filesystem_capacity_bytes * 100",
          "legendFormat": "{{k8s_node_name}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 107,
      "title": "Total Pods",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": "__DATASOURCE_MIMIR__",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 44,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 6
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "count(count by (k8s_namespace_name, k8s_pod_name) (k8s_pod_cpu_usage))",
          "legendFormat": "pods"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 108,
      "title": "Total Nodes",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": "__DATASOURCE_MIMIR__",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 44,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 6
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "count(count by (k8s_node_name) (k8s_node_cpu_usage))",
          "legendFormat": "nodes"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 109,
      "title": "Collector Uptime (longest-running instance)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": "__DATASOURCE_MIMIR__",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 20,
        "y": 44,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 6
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max(otelcol_process_uptime_total)",
          "legendFormat": "uptime"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 110,
      "title": "Telemetry Ingest Rate (accepted, per second)",
      "description": "The gateway collector's own receiver-level metrics - self-monitoring data, lives under the anonymous tenant like all self-scraped metrics, not this system's own tenant. See README.md's Multi-Tenancy section.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": "Mimir-anonymous",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 50,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_receiver_accepted_spans_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "spans"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_receiver_accepted_metric_points_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "metric points"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_receiver_accepted_log_records_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "log records"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 111,
      "title": "Telemetry Refused/Failed Rate (per second)",
      "description": "The gateway collector's own receiver-level metrics - self-monitoring data, lives under the anonymous tenant like all self-scraped metrics, not this system's own tenant. See README.md's Multi-Tenancy section.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": "Mimir-anonymous",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 50,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_receiver_refused_spans_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "refused spans"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_receiver_refused_metric_points_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "refused metric points"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_receiver_refused_log_records_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "refused log records"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 112,
      "title": "Persistent Volume Usage (LGTM stack)",
      "description": "PVC-backed volume usage for the observability namespace's own stateful components (Mimir/Loki/Tempo ingesters+compactors+store-gateways, Grafana, Kafka, MinIO) - not every k8s_volume_name in this namespace, only PVC-backed ones. Wrapped both sides of the division in max by (k8s_pod_name, k8s_volume_name)(...) - found live that a pod rescheduled to a different node briefly produces two label sets for the same k8s_pod_name (differing only in k8s_node_name, one per reporting node-agent), which PromQL's on(...) join can't disambiguate (\"found duplicate series\"); max collapses that back to one value regardless of which node currently reports it. The kubeletstats receiver's volume metric group doesn't expose a volume-type label to distinguish PVC from ConfigMap/Secret/projected-token/emptyDir volumes, so this filters by an explicit pod+volume-name allowlist verified live against `kubectl get pvc -n observability` instead - update it if a new stateful component is added to the stack.",
      "type": "table",
      "datasource": "__DATASOURCE_MIMIR__",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 58,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 80
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 90
              }
            ]
          },
          "custom": {
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "color-background"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "k8s_pod_name"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "displayName",
                "value": "Pod"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "auto"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "none"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "k8s_volume_name"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "displayName",
                "value": "Volume"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "auto"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "none"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "indexByName": {},
            "renameByName": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "expr": "100 * (1 - max by (k8s_pod_name, k8s_volume_name) (k8s_volume_available_bytes{k8s_namespace_name=\"observability\", k8s_pod_name=~\"loki-compactor-.*|loki-ingester-zone-.*|tempo-kafka-.*|mimir-compactor-.*|mimir-ingester-zone-.*|mimir-store-gateway-zone-.*|mimir-kafka-.*|minio-.*|grafana-.*\", k8s_volume_name=~\"data|storage|grafana|kafka-data|export\"}) / on(k8s_pod_name, k8s_volume_name) max by (k8s_pod_name, k8s_volume_name) (k8s_volume_capacity_bytes{k8s_namespace_name=\"observability\", k8s_pod_name=~\"loki-compactor-.*|loki-ingester-zone-.*|tempo-kafka-.*|mimir-compactor-.*|mimir-ingester-zone-.*|mimir-store-gateway-zone-.*|mimir-kafka-.*|minio-.*|grafana-.*\", k8s_volume_name=~\"data|storage|grafana|kafka-data|export\"}))",
          "legendFormat": "__auto"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
